# 12.1 Social UI tile styling (self-gated, inert on 12.0)
EUI_Friends_Tiles_121.lua

# EUI_Friends_Groups_121.lua is deliberately NOT loaded. Every renderer it can
# use taints BNet whispers on 12.1 (proven by bisect: mutating the friends list
# data in any form -- our rows, our element data, or merely re-parenting
# Blizzard's own nodes -- taints the execution Blizzard's secure OnClick needs,
# and SetTellTarget's whisper target is a secret value there). Kept on disk so
# the work is not lost if a later patch changes the rules.

# Options
EUI_Friends_Options.lua
